{
  "name": "Daily SEC 8-K Cyber Breach, Restatement & C-Suite Exit Alert (Apify -> Slack)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Daily SEC Form 8-K Corporate Risk & Distress Monitor\n\nAutomatically scans official **SEC EDGAR Form 8-K** filings every market weekday for high-severity events:\n- **Item 1.05**: Material Cybersecurity Incidents\n- **Item 4.01 / 4.02**: Auditor Resignations & Financial Restatements\n- **Item 1.03 / 3.01**: Bankruptcy & Delisting Notices\n- **Item 5.02**: CEO / CFO Departures\n\n### Setup (2 minutes)\n1. Get a free [Apify API Token](https://apify.com/durative_hairstreak/sec-8k-risk-signals).\n2. In **Run SEC 8-K Risk Signals Actor**, add a **Header Auth** credential:\n   - **Name**: `Authorization`\n   - **Value**: `Bearer YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN`\n3. Connect your **Slack** credential and target `#risk-alerts` channel in the last node.\n4. *(Optional)* Switch `mode` to `\"ticker_audit\"` and pass your watchlist `\"tickers\": [\"NVDA\", \"TSLA\", \"SMCI\"]`.\n\n*Powered by [RiskOps MCP Suite](https://www.localledgerstudio.xyz/).*",
        "height": 450,
        "width": 390,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "sticky-sec-guide",
      "name": "Setup Guide",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -140,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Alert Threshold\nOnly filings with deterministic `riskScore >= 70` (RED / CRITICAL red flags) trigger Slack notifications so your channel stays noise-free.",
        "height": 130,
        "width": 340,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "sticky-sec-filter",
      "name": "Noise Filter Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        740,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 13 * * 1-5"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "cron-trigger",
      "name": "Every Weekday 13:00 UTC",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        300,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/durative_hairstreak~sec-8k-risk-signals/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{\n  \"mode\": \"market_scan\",\n  \"riskItems\": [\"1.05\", \"4.01\", \"4.02\", \"1.03\", \"3.01\", \"5.02\"],\n  \"lookbackDays\": 2,\n  \"maxResults\": 20,\n  \"includeExcerpts\": true,\n  \"minRiskScore\": 65\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 120000
        }
      },
      "id": "apify-call",
      "name": "Run SEC 8-K Risk Signals Actor",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        540,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-risk-score",
              "leftValue": "={{ Number($json.riskScore ?? 0) }}",
              "rightValue": 70,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "gte"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "filter-red",
      "name": "Filter RED / HIGH Alerts (>=70)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        800,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "C0000000000",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "text": "=:rotating_light: *SEC 8-K Risk Alert* ({{ $json.riskTrafficLight }} {{ $json.riskScore }}/100)\n*Company:* {{ $json.companyName }} ({{ $json.ticker || 'N/A' }})\n*Filed:* {{ $json.filingDate }} | *Form:* {{ $json.formType }} | *Items:* {{ ($json.matchedRiskItems || []).join(', ') }}\n*Red Flags:* {{ ($json.detectedRedFlags || []).join('; ') || 'None' }}\n*Filing:* {{ $json.filingUrl }}",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "id": "slack-alert",
      "name": "Post to Slack Risk Channel",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1060,
        260
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Every Weekday 13:00 UTC": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Run SEC 8-K Risk Signals Actor",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Run SEC 8-K Risk Signals Actor": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Filter RED / HIGH Alerts (>=70)",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Filter RED / HIGH Alerts (>=70)": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Post to Slack Risk Channel",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false
  }
}
